  "title": {
   "en": "The Man Living Downstairs"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "아랫집 남자"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Man Downstairs"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "On the eve of her wedding, Jiyoo discovers her fiancé has been cheating and immediately calls off the engagement.\nDevastated, she breaks down—smashing up her nearly-finished newlywed home.\n\nThen comes a knock.\nA man from the downstairs unit, complaining about the noise.\n\nIn a moment of drunken impulse, she blurts out:\n\n“Will you hold me?”\n“If we keep going, I won’t stop.”\n\nHis long fingers slide into her hair, their lips press together, and he whispers:\n\n“Remember everything. If you say you were too drunk and forget, I’ll be mad.”\n\nShe thought it was just a one-time fling.\nBut then—why is he standing in her new office?\n\n“I’m Cha Jaewook. Let’s get along.”\n\nTurns out, the sexy downstairs neighbor is not just her new coworker—he’s the company’s CEO.\nAnd now he’s flirting openly:\n\n“Assistant Manager Yoo Jiyoo. Let’s date… at work.”"
  },
